### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Register user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telegram_id": 12345,
  "username": "testuser",
  "first_name": "Test"
}

### Get user by telegram ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/me?telegram_id=12345
Accept: application/json

### Create gratitude entry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/gratitudes?user_id=REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "I am grateful for today's sunshine"
}

### List gratitude entries
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/gratitudes?user_id=REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Accept: application/json
